+-   $h_{max}$: Maximum step size. Default: 2.0 voxel units [S1]. Prevents missing high-frequency details (e.g., thin leaves) [S1].
+-   $\epsilon$: Error tolerance. Tested values: 0.01, 0.005, 0.001 [S1].
 
